/**
 * Vector REAVE wordmark — logo silhouette filled with a slow lava-lamp gradient.
 * Letter groups keep the homepage cascade; each clips a shared animated layer.
 * CSS keyframes (not SMIL) — Chrome does not run SVG SMIL animations.
 */

/** Subpaths for the homepage letter cascade (same geometry, split for animation). */
